SUMMARY:Day 1 | PYTHON: Environment + Git workflow
DESCRIPTION:Week 1: Setup + Python fast-track\nProject: Project 0: Vitals L
 ogger CLI\n\nStart with a 15-min Python warm-up (Exercism or Kaggle Learn 
 exercise).\n\nDO: Install Python 3.12 + VS Code\, create a venv\, clone/re
 organise your healthcare-ai-journey repo with the folder layout from the R
 EADME. Do 10 mini-exercises (functions\, loops\, conditionals) to test out
  of the basics you already know.\n\nSHIP: First commit with the new repo l
 ayout + exercises/week01.py\n\nWhen done\, log it: python tools/daylog.py
CATEGORIES:PYTHON
